msgid "The app could not use the GPU. Turn on GPU acceleration."
msgstr "L’application n’a pas pu utiliser le GPU. Active l’accélération GPU."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:410
msgid "Graphics driver files are hidden"
msgstr "Les fichiers du pilote graphique sont cachés"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:410
msgid ""
"The GPU driver could not load in SAM's minimal system view. Show all of /usr."
msgstr ""
"Le pilote GPU n’a pas pu se charger dans la vue minimale du système de SAM. "
"Affiche tout /usr."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:435
msgid "The app wants your keyring"
msgstr "L’application veut ton trousseau"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:435
msgid ""
"The app tried to store or read a login. Allowing the keyring lets it read "
"every password stored there."
msgstr ""
"L’application a tenté d’enregistrer ou de lire des identifiants. Autoriser "
"le trousseau lui permet de lire chaque mot de passe qui y est enregistré."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:446
msgid "The app wants media controls"
msgstr "L’application veut les contrôles multimédias"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:446
msgid "Allow media keys and keeping the screen awake."
msgstr "Autoriser les touches multimédias et garder l’écran allumé."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:454
msgid "The app asked for a dangerous service"
msgstr "L’application a demandé un service dangereux"

#. Keep the {placeholders}; their order may change.
#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:457
msgid ""
"The app tried to use {why}. SAM does not offer this: it would let the app "
"escape the sandbox."
msgstr ""
"L’application a tenté d’utiliser {why}. SAM ne le propose pas : cela "
"permettrait à l’application de sortir du bac à sable."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:462
msgid "A desktop service is blocked"
msgstr "Un service du bureau est bloqué"

#. Keep the {placeholders}; their order may change.
#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:465
msgid ""
"The app tried to use {name}, which the D-Bus filter blocks. Allow just this "
"service."
msgstr ""
"L’application a tenté d’utiliser {name}, que le filtre D-Bus bloque. "
"N’autorise que ce service."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:490
msgid "Sound is off"
msgstr "Le son est désactivé"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:490
msgid "The app tried to use audio. Turn on sound."
msgstr "L’application a tenté d’utiliser le son. Active le son."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:505
msgid "The app wants PipeWire directly"
msgstr "L’application veut PipeWire directement"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:505
msgid ""
"It has sound through PulseAudio, but tried to connect to PipeWire itself. "
"Direct access also reaches cameras and other apps' screen streams; allow it "
"only if sound does not work otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Elle a du son via PulseAudio, mais a tenté de se connecter directement à "
"PipeWire. L’accès direct atteint aussi les caméras et les flux d’écran "
"d’autres applications ; ne l’autorise que si le son ne fonctionne pas "
"autrement."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:508
msgid "The app starts another AppImage"
msgstr "L’application lance un autre AppImage"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:508
msgid ""
"It tried to mount an AppImage with FUSE, which is not available in a "
"sandbox. SAM already asks AppImages to unpack themselves instead; if this "
"still fails, the inner app needs its own sandbox."
msgstr ""
"Elle a tenté de monter un AppImage avec FUSE, qui n’est pas disponible dans "
"un bac à sable. SAM demande déjà aux AppImage de se décompresser eux-mêmes à "
"la place ; si cela échoue malgré tout, l’application intérieure a besoin de "
"son propre bac à sable."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:515
msgid "The app crashed"
msgstr "L’application a planté"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:515
msgid ""
"A crash right at start is often a missing system file. Showing all of /usr "
"is the safest first step."
msgstr ""
"Un plantage dès le démarrage vient souvent d’un fichier système manquant. "
"Afficher tout /usr est la première étape la plus sûre."

